; Audited against data/effects.txt TEXT, lines 2630-2659; corrected locally.
; NAME ids: First=43, Second=41, Third=42, Spirit of the Pharaoh=44.
; Self.246 records the last placement turn + 1, initialized to zero.
; Ordinary Spell/Trap Zone capacity is five; no Field Zone placement.
; LEFT_FIELD record: SUBJECT=39, SOURCE_ZONE=61, PREVIOUS_CONTROLLER=196,
; FACE_UP=4 snapshots the departed card. SUBJECT uses the invocation address
; when First itself leaves. Cleanup reacts only to own Sarcophagus departure.
; Combo requires this face-up First and face-up Second and Third; validate
; Pharaoh presence and a free monster slot before sending the Sarcophagi.

